      "section": "ELECTRONIC VOLTAGE REGULATOR",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 334.7717,
        "t": 691.4254068359375,
        "r": 550.8641000000001,
        "b": 680.6061469606776
      },
      "content": "ELECTRONIC VOLTAGE REGULATOR",
      "level": 2,
      "section_id": "sec_auto_337",
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_5",
          "title": "5. Generator Set/Voltage Regulator"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_337",
          "title": "ELECTRONIC VOLTAGE REGULATOR"
        }
      ],
      "parent_section_id": "sec_5",
      "section_level": 2,
      "page": 27,
      "chunk_hint": "section_heading",
      "semantic_role": "section_heading",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0325",
      "reading_order": 338,
      "section": "ELECTRONIC VOLTAGE REGULATOR",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 320.93859999999995,
        "t": 666.1594068359375,
        "r": 564.7524999999997,
        "b": 630.9020492035387
      },
      "content": "The voltage regulator controls the output of the generator set so that a constant voltage is maintained under varying load conditions.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_337",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_5",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_5",
          "title": "5. Generator Set/Voltage Regulator"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_337",
          "title": "ELECTRONIC VOLTAGE REGULATOR"
        }
      ],
      "page": 27,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0326",
      "reading_order": 339,
      "section": "ELECTRONIC VOLTAGE REGULATOR",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 320.93859999999995,
        "t": 614.7388068359375,
        "r": 564.8888999999999,
        "b": 503.6276492035389
      },
      "content": "Only the basic functions of the regulator are described (Figure 5-5).  Voltage from quadrature windings Q1/Q2 supply power to the voltage regulator itself.  The voltage regulator in turn supplies an excitation voltage (F1/F2) that is directly proportionate to  the  output  voltage  (L1/L0)  it  senses.    Any changes in the generator set output voltage produce a corresponding change in the excitation voltage provided by the regulator.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_337",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_5",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_5",
          "title": "5. Generator Set/Voltage Regulator"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_337",
          "title": "ELECTRONIC VOLTAGE REGULATOR"
        }
      ],
      "page": 27,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0327",
      "reading_order": 340,
      "section": "ELECTRONIC VOLTAGE REGULATOR",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 320.93859999999995,
        "t": 487.40830683593765,
        "r": 564.7524999999991,
        "b": 426.923549203539
      },
      "content": "On the HDKAG, the voltage regulator assembly includes a potentiometer which enables a slight degree of output voltage adjustment.  The voltage regulator assembly contains no user-serviceable parts.  If the assembly fails, it must be replaced.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_337",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_5",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_5",
          "title": "5. Generator Set/Voltage Regulator"
        },
        {
